le, entitlement, multiplayer, or safety service.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0002\",\"IMP-0004\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"docs/security-boundary.md\",\"tests/core/connected-scope-exclusion.*\"],\"data\":[\"future connected-service approval checklist\"],\"api\":[\"local-slot identity contract\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"sign-in\",\"OAuth\",\"sync\",\"roles\",\"moderation\",\"purchases\",\"server APIs\"],\"verification\":\"Static scan and negative fixtures find no identity/token/privilege fields or network client in P0 foundation modules.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"GATE-0006 / DEC-0006 before any connected implementation.\",\"complexity\":\"low\",\"status\":\"current\"},\n    {\"id\":\"IMP-0009\",\"title\":\"Define privacy-safe local diagnostics boundary\",\"domain\":\"privacy\",\"targets\":[\"web\",\"pwa\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0012\",\"NFR-0006\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"A bounded local diagnostic schema, consent and clear controls, redaction rules, and no-network guardrails support future player recovery without collecting save or dialogue payloads.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0002\",\"IMP-0003\",\"IMP-0006\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"src/platform/web/diagnostics/\",\"src/app/recovery/diagnostic-contract.*\",\"tests/platform/diagnostics.*\",\"docs/privacy-and-recovery.md\"],\"data\":[\"redacted local diagnostic record\",\"consent state\"],\"api\":[\"diagnostic recorder interface\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"diagnostic provider/transport\",\"remote analytics\",\"retention promise\",\"secrets\"],\"verification\":\"Tests prove diagnostics are absent without consent, redact payloads, and can be deleted locally.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"GATE-0005 / DEC-0005 before transport, retention, hosting, or support claims.\",\"complexity\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"gated\"},\n    {\"id\":\"IMP-0010\",\"title\":\"Establish semantic accessibility design tokens\",\"domain\":\"accessibility\",\"targets\":[\"shared\",\"web\",\"pwa\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0007\",\"REQ-001